:: Campus Lecture Hall
<<initPlayState>>\
<<if !School.isSchoolDay()>><<goto "Linkon University">><</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("campus-lecture-hall", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<set _lectureToday to School.period3Subject() === "Guest Lecture">>\
<<if School.earlyArrival("lectureHall")>>\
<<schoolEarly "lectureHall">>\
<<elseif _lectureToday>>\
<<set _guest to School.fridayGuestId()>>\
<<set _guestName to LoveInterests.displayName(_guest)>>\
<<pronouns _guest>>\
You are in the lecture hall. Tiered seats slope down towards the stage, where today's guest speaker is <<= _guestName>>.
<<if _guest === "rafayel">>\
<<Rafayel>> talks about light, color, and the stubborn honesty of a blank canvas — half lecture, half performance.
<<elseif _guest === "zayne">>\
<<Zayne>> keeps the tone clinical and calm, walking through cardiac health with the patience of someone used to translating hard science.
<<elseif _guest === "valko">>\
<<Valko>> covers EonCore tech in plain language — systems, safeguards, and what happens when elegant machines meet messy humans.
<</if>>\
<<else>>\
You stand in the lecture hall. Tiered seats slope down toward an empty stage; without a guest speaker booked, the room is dim and quiet.
<</if>>

<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the lecture hall <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Linkon University">><</link>>
